After code execution, what will be the value of `forEachRes` and `mapRes`?

```js
const numbers = [1, 1, 1, 1, 1];
let sum = 0;
const forEachRes = numbers.forEach(num => {
  return (sum += num);
});
const mapRes = numbers.map(num => {
  return (sum += num);
});
```

